IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. BATCHJOB.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
COPY ACCESSAREA.
01 RECORD-DECISION PIC X(4).
01 JOB-STATUS PIC X(4).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
COPY BATCHCTL.

1000-INITIALISE SECTION.
    MOVE SPACES TO ACCESS-AREA RECORD-DECISION.
    MOVE 'OK' TO JOB-STATUS.

2000-PRIMARY-READ SECTION.
    MOVE 'FIRST' TO ACCESS-FUNCTION.
    CALL 'DATAACCESS' USING ACCESS-AREA
        ON EXCEPTION
            MOVE 'FAIL' TO ACCESS-STATUS
    END-CALL.

2500-VALIDATE SECTION.
    IF REQUEST-STATE = 'PENDING'
        MOVE 'OK' TO RECORD-DECISION
    ELSE
        MOVE 'SKIP' TO RECORD-DECISION
    END-IF.

3000-UPDATE SECTION.
    MOVE 'DONE' TO TARGET-STATE.
    MOVE 'SAVE' TO ACCESS-FUNCTION.
    CALL 'DATAACCESS' USING ACCESS-AREA
        ON EXCEPTION
            MOVE 'FAIL' TO ACCESS-STATUS
    END-CALL.
    IF ACCESS-STATUS NOT = 'OK'
        MOVE 'IOER' TO JOB-STATUS
    END-IF.

4000-CLOSE SECTION.
    MOVE 'CLOSE' TO ACCESS-FUNCTION.
    CALL 'DATAACCESS' USING ACCESS-AREA
        ON EXCEPTION
            MOVE 'FAIL' TO ACCESS-STATUS
    END-CALL.
    IF ACCESS-STATUS NOT = 'OK'
        MOVE 'IOER' TO JOB-STATUS
    END-IF.
